Raven's JAGS 4.3.2 built-in catalog records clean-room factual interoperability
metadata (names, roles, aliases, arities, and automatically loaded module
ownership) independently verified against the official JAGS 4.3.2 source
release:

https://downloads.sourceforge.net/project/mcmc-jags/JAGS/4.x/Source/JAGS-4.3.2.tar.gz
SHA-256: 871f556af403a7c2ce6a0f02f15cf85a572763e093d26658ebac55c4ab472fc8

JAGS is GPL-2.0-only. Raven does not copy or bundle JAGS implementation code,
source structure, manual prose, tables, examples, or comments, and does not
link or load JAGS at runtime for this feature. The reference above is retained
for provenance and reproducibility.

